Run Setup/Config
Graphics Debug True
Graphics Add_Window Install_Check "Appeal Graphics installation check" 320 240
Graphics Window_Open Install_Check
Print_Global Graphics.Window.Install_Check.Open
Graphics Draw_Rect Check 10 10 100 50 255 0 0 255
Graphics Render
Graphics Close_All
Graphics Window_Open Install_Check
Print_Global Graphics.Window.Install_Check.Open
Print "GRAPHICS_INSTALL_PASSED"
Return
